'''Axis Base''' was the criminal [[Vanguard Axis]]'s base of operations on board the [[Ordo Tera Spaceport]] [[space station]], which the group controlled.<ref name="CGttSWG" /> They used the base for activities including the trafficking of [[Slavery|enslaved]] individuals, such as the [[Padawan]] [[Wookiee]] [[Gungi]].<ref name="Tribe">{{TBB|Tribe}}</ref>

